<section>
  <h3>Welcome to ACKS II version {{version}}!</h3>
  <p>
    Join us on <a href="https://discord.gg/RRsNCSUprY">Discord</a>.
    Report issues and request features on <a href="https://github.com/AutarchLLC/foundryvtt-acks-core/issues">Github</a>.
  </p>
  <h4>What's new:</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>MISC: This release requires Foundry v14. Foundry v13 is no longer supported.</li>
    <li>NEW: <b>Attack Throw dialog</b> for all attacks, with a live preview of the throw and damage. Results post to a
      new <b>Attack Throw chat card</b>, with an <b>Apply Damage</b> button for the GM.
    </li>
    <li>NEW: Weapon rework: damage types, alternate damage, and separate attack and damage bonuses.</li>
    <li>NEW: Settings for the optional <b>Critical Hits</b> rule, showing the target's AC to players, and hiding Fate
      points (<b>Heroic Fate</b>).
    </li>
    <li>NEW: Saving throws renamed to Implements and Blast. Attribute modifiers are calculated automatically.</li>
    <li>NEW: <b>Judge Macros</b> compendium and refreshed Adventuring Equipment compendium.</li>
    <li>FIX: Active Effect controls on actor sheets work again.</li>
    <li>FIX: Sheets open again when one of their hirelings has been deleted.</li>
    <li>Various other internal changes, fixes and improvements.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
